WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:00.873
- Wow.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.100
Bro, this is me living my best life.

00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:08.520
Hey, what's up, y'all?

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.493
I'm KYLE.

00:00:09.493 --> 00:00:12.037
♪ Girl I know you playing with me ♪

00:00:12.037 --> 00:00:13.800
♪ Girl who are you playing with ♪

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.590
Super Duper Kyle, that is my alter ego,

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.320
that is the version of
myself that is unstoppable.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.960
- Hi, my name is Karl Altstaetter,

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.310
and I've been a comic
book artist for 25 years,

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.020
and I'm here to turn
KYLE into the superhero

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.510
he's always imagined he could be.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.420
Tell me about your superhero alter ego.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.770
- KYLE is kind of like
a shy, nerdy drama kid,

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.300
and then Super Duper Kyle
was his voice in his head

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.660
that's like 'nah, dude,
you're a superstar.'

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.950
- [Karl] What's his
most prominent feature?

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.640
- He's got these big ass
teeth, and he goes like this,

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:50.250
like big as hell, and they
just shine dummy bright,

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.390
like (high-pitched humming),

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:54.170
and then people are like (screaming) gosh.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:55.170
He's gotta be kinda swole.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.990
Can you make me semi-swole?
- Absolutely.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.190
- He's definitely swole.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.420
I would love to go just
fly high up into the clouds

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.700
and kinda just get away from everything

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.850
and just be able to look
down at the sky and just,

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:05.720
you know, chill.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.960
And he's a little tall,
you know what I mean?

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.930
Not too tall, but he's kinda tall.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:11.833
Attractive.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:13.443
Yes.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.970
Wow.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:23.250
Oh my God (laughs).

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.120
Yo, dude, this is crazy.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:27.730
- Well, one of the things you mentioned

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.090
that really resonated with me

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:31.800
was you flying above
everything in a positive way,

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.750
and that's really what
I wanted to capture.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.980
So, there's sort of the gray
clouds and the city here,

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:37.743
and you're sort of above it.
- Yeah.

00:01:37.743 --> 00:01:41.110
- Going towards sort of
the positive energy up top.

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:43.220
- This made me think a
lot about the, you know,

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:45.670
the person I'm trying to
be, you know what I mean?

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:47.150
Even more than what I am today,

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:50.010
I think I wanna leave
this room and try and be

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:52.380
more of this version of myself.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.080
Everybody is somebody's superhero,

00:01:54.109 --> 00:01:57.180
and based on how you act
out there in the world,

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.043
you know what I mean?

00:01:58.043 --> 00:02:00.480
Depends on who's gonna say
that about you one day.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.680
This was eye-opening, dude, and this is...

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:03.513
This is tight.

00:02:03.513 --> 00:02:04.346
Wait, can I show it to the...

00:02:04.346 --> 00:02:05.179
Can I touch it?

00:02:05.179 --> 00:02:06.012
I'm sorry.
- Go ahead.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:07.490
- Bro, this is (bleep) epic.

00:02:08.362 --> 00:02:10.497
(laughing)

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:13.664
(inspirational music)

